<title>USA: Prudential Securities hires Pfeifer as oil analyst.</title>
<headline>Prudential Securities hires Pfeifer as oil analyst.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said on Tuesday that its Energy Group had hired Steven Pfeifer as senior international and domestic oil analyst.</p>
<p>Pfeifer joined Prudential from Paine Webber, the company said in statement, prior to which he covered thirteen international and domestic oil companies for C.J. Lawrence/Deutsche Bank.</p>
